## 4bb6dfb8 Count the database password default in compose four times in the install test

The keeper and migrate now read POSTGRES_PASSWORD with the same default as the app, so the compose file names it four times, not twice. The author check of the first commit showed this one red test.

Ruling: edit test/install-script.test.ts outside the task's file list - why: this task's compose change turns its count of the password default from 2 to 4 and nothing else in it changes - cost if wrong: Task 8, which owns the install path, may touch the same line and need a trivial merge.

